#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kiten.appdata.xml:13
msgid "Kiten is a Japanese reference and study tool. It features an English to Japanese and Japanese to English dictionary, as well as a Kanji dictionary. For the Kanji dictionary there are multiple ways supported to look up characters."
msgstr "Kiten je japanski referentni alat za učenje. Sadrži englesko-japanski i japansko-engleski rječnik te rječnik kanjija. U rječniku kanjija znakove je moguće potražiti na više načina."

